    {
      "assistant": "It wasn't meant to hurt, and it still landed. That's allowed.\n\nThe thing about being the one who never makes a fuss is that people stop seeing it as a choice you make. It becomes just a fact about you — the easy one — and then there's nowhere for the times you're not fine to go.\n\nYou said small. That word stuck with me. That's what it does, isn't it — being praised for taking up no space ends up making you feel like you take up none.\n\nDinner's over now, so what's it like sitting with it after everyone's gone home?",
      "at": "2026-10-17T23:10:00.000Z",
      "stepId": "praise",
      "terminalEvent": "assistant_committed",
      "type": "say",
      "user": "At dinner tonight Imogen told everyone I am the easiest person in the family, never any fuss. They all laughed and agreed. I know it was meant kindly and I just feel small."
    }
